# /etc/pam.d/promise-webpam - PAM service for WebPAM Linux-credential login.
# promise-pam-auth verifies allowlisted Linux users through this stack. It uses
# the system's standard auth + account modules (pam_unix, plus whatever the box
# layers on: pam_faillock, MFA, etc.), so WebPAM login honours the same policy
# as a console/SSH login.
@include common-auth
@include common-account
